{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Valliya (3rd)","html":"<article id='thag2.24'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 2.24 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 2.24 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dukanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Twos </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Tatiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Three </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Valliyattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Valliya (3rd) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yaṁ kiccaṁ daḷhavīriyena, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The duty of one whose energy is strong; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yaṁ kiccaṁ boddhumicchatā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the duty of one who longs to wake up: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Karissaṁ nāvarajjhissaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>that I’ll do, I won’t fail—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>passa vīriyaṁ parakkamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>see my energy and vigor! </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tvañca me maggamakkhāhi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Teach me the path, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>añjasaṁ amatogadhaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the direct route whose objective is freedom from death. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ahaṁ monena monissaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ll know it with wisdom, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>gaṅgāsotova sāgaran”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>as the Ganges knows the ocean. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Valliyo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
